<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston on Unifi.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston on Unifi.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it named Unifi Inc, a texturizer of polyester filament fibers, as its weekly featured stock.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/8 at 30-5/8.</p>
</text>
